[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0010","text":"────啊，那边，在施工呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0020","text":"啊～，真的呢\n在盖什么呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0030","text":"嗯……\n便利店之类的……吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0040","text":"呐，透前辈觉得会是什么呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0050","text":"诶？\n嗯……饭团店之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0060","text":"那不就是浅仓的午饭嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0070","text":"啊哈～♡\n要是猜中了就好了呢～～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0080","text":"呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0090","text":"好期待呢～，饭团店"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_02_0100","text":"还不知道呢，现在"}]
